{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe air in the Burg greenhouses is thick with the scent of orange blossoms, a sharp contrast to the stale study air in Berlin. I walked the Emperor’s private path today, entering through an underground passage he uses for his afternoon retreats. It is a curious thing, to walk in the footsteps of absolute power while smelling damp earth and rotting fruit. I paid six kreuzer for a bottle of water and a small cake, which was dry and tasteless.\n\nI met a young professor from Prague, eager to discuss Fries. I told him plainly that his system is a house of cards; he looked pale, then left. I am tired from the walk and the heat. The light here is yellow, unlike our clear blue. I hope Karl’s health is steady. I shall write again from Brno. Give my regards to Immanuel.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219133,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":191,"prompt_tokens":1075,"total_tokens":1266,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-PrrdkWar677M6Whc2SEpNNzg8hUo1j9g","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1075,"prompt_ms":1145.713,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.065779534883721,"prompt_per_second":938.2803546787023,"predicted_n":191,"predicted_ms":4492.402,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.64422105263158,"predicted_per_second":42.29363267134152}}